WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.626 --> 00:00:06.543
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:28.750
- [Narrator] There is a
place in northern Guizhou

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.960
where spice reigns supreme.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.003
It's become known, simply,
as China Chili City.

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:39.869
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:53.297 --> 00:00:55.570
The town is home to the
largest chili market in China,

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.453
which produces countless
tons of chilies annually.

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:01.450
One worker can manually process

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:04.043
over 200 pounds of chili every day.

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:09.967
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:16.310
The market processes
many types of chilies,

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:19.360
but each has a flavor
profile unique to Guizhou.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:21.480
Instead of a numbing level of spiciness,

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:23.240
found in neighboring provinces,

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:25.100
the peppers from Guizhou are uniquely

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.053
both sour and spicy.

00:01:28.017 --> 00:01:31.934
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:42.495 --> 00:01:44.600
The peppers are then
shipped around the world,

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:46.500
and the locals are fiercely proud

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:47.853
of their fiery export.

00:01:50.415 --> 00:01:54.332
(speaking in foreign language)

